#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:3
#: 257774c22b65411894f9c6e1c9d7218c
msgid "随机掺杂（Random Doping）"
msgstr "Random Doping"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:5
#: e6b9d141d9db45a2af4b8591b291a81d
msgid "**分类：** 合金与组分"
msgstr "**Category:** Alloys and composition"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:7
#: b201ce4f9cf54d609b6efe2c637dda36
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:9
#: 606e357ede6042c58915af1f8ae8eeb9
msgid ""
"按规则表对指定元素位点做替位掺杂。可以精确控制\"替换谁、换成什么、换多少\"，"
"支持按原子百分比、质量百分比或固定数量采样。规则填写了 group 时，输入必须真的"
"带有对应标签；卡片不会把缺失的 group 当成“全部位点”。"
msgstr "Perform substitutional doping on selected element sites according to a rule table. Control exactly \"which elements to replace, what to replace them with, and how many\", using atomic percentages, mass percentages, or fixed counts. When a rule specifies a group, the input must actually carry that label; the card does not treat a missing group as \"all sites\"."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:11
#: d099827b4cef42a79460adbdbdf5a6d0
msgid "**和 `Random Occupancy` / `Composition Space Sampling` 的区别：**"
msgstr "**Difference from `Random Occupancy` / `Composition Space Sampling`:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:12
#: 2bea7697c13a4eaa81a0c02a83893a0a
msgid "`Composition Space Sampling`：定义\"目标配比空间\"，不改原子占位"
msgstr "`Composition Space Sampling`: defines a \"target composition space\" without changing site occupancy"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:13
#: 0e0067cbe4794a52b7615e8a8d20a438
msgid ""
"`Random Occupancy`：把目标配比落到离散占位上，需要输入有 `Comp(...)` 标签"
msgstr ""
"`Random Occupancy` realizes target fractions as discrete occupations, "
"usually from a `Comp(...)` label."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:14
#: d3cb3987b2304596a4ed63cb9d717bf0
msgid ""
"`Random Doping`：直接给定规则（target + dopants + 比例），做一次随机替换。更"
"直接、更手工，但不扫配比空间"
msgstr ""
"`Random Doping` directly applies target, dopant, and amount rules. It is "
"explicit and local, not a composition-space scan."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:16
#: 8ba02d181ba64a578c479db802cfd007
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principle and equations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:18
#: 0ad4a4791b564eeab63eadea961bd678
msgid ""
"每条规则先按目标元素和可选 group 得到 $N_{\\mathrm{eligible}}$ 个候选位点。`"
"原子百分比` 模式使用"
msgstr "Each rule first selects $N_{\\mathrm{eligible}}$ eligible sites by target element and optional group. `Atomic percentage` mode uses"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:21
#: f3b2d24169fb44b29a314d0ea54b1cb0
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{dope}}=\\left\\lfloor\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{eligible}}\\,p_{\\mathrm{atom}}\\right\\rfloor.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:26
#: 9cc861d3a6e7489bab94b383c2ff113d
msgid "若输入的是掺杂元素质量权重 $w_e$，程序先换算成原子抽样权重"
msgstr "If mass weights $w_e$ are supplied for dopants, the program first converts them to atomic sampling weights"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:28
#: 671d845600d047f69aab0e5c64abb86c
msgid ""
"\n"
"p_e=\\frac{w_e/M_e}{\\sum_j w_j/M_j},\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:32
#: 94fd21f057de4b16b75c314a53ec2a05
msgid ""
"其中 $M_e$ 是元素原子质量。`固定数量`直接使用指定整数；`随机数量`在给定上下限"
"内抽取。 确定总数后，`精确`替换按最大余数法分配各掺杂元素计数，`随机`替换按类"
"别概率逐位点抽样。 质量百分比模式按当前实现用目标原子的总质量和掺杂物平均原子"
"质量估算个数，因此输出后仍应 重新统计实际最终质量分数。"
msgstr "Here $M_e$ is the atomic mass of element $e$. `Fixed count` uses the specified integer; `Random count` samples within the given bounds. After determining the total, `Exact` replacement allocates dopant counts by the largest-remainder method, while `Random` replacement samples each site by category probability. In mass-percentage mode, the current implementation estimates the count from the total target-atom mass and average dopant mass, so recompute the actual final mass fraction after generation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:37
#: dff89e878e8c47cba92dcacfa3651f62
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:39
#: e8b49189d208400ea3e3ad312535d4bc
msgid "场景：纯元素模型在掺杂体系上完全失效"
msgstr "Scenario: A pure-element model fails on a doped system"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:41
#: ce723c713a914dcaa33728ef7e48505a
msgid ""
"你在纯 Si 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，能量和力都收敛得很好。然后尝试跑 Si:Ge 合金"
"——模型直接崩溃：碰到 Ge 原子的局域环境完全没见过，力预测误差跳了一个数量级。"
msgstr ""
"A pure-Si NEP has converged energy and force errors, but force error "
"increases by an order of magnitude on Si:Ge because Ge-centered local "
"environments are absent from training."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:43
#: e63862fc74a74e74bc858edae81316e0
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 训练集里只有 Si-Si 键环境，模型不知道 Ge 原子的存在，更不知道 "
"Si-Ge 键和 Ge-Ge 键应该长什么样。需要往训练集中加入真实的 Si 位点被 Ge 替换的"
"结构，让模型学习掺杂原子周围的局域化学环境。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** A set containing only Si-Si environments cannot represent Si-"
"Ge or Ge-Ge chemistry. Generate actual Ge substitutions on Si sites, then "
"relax and label them so the model learns dopant-centered environments."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:45
#: 51b69e929c314478943574988f65515c
msgid "**输入：** 一个纯 Si 超胞结构，已经弛豫"
msgstr "**Input:** A relaxed pure-Si supercell."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:47
#: 324a21ba31024fe5acb3b2ad8c3a13d2
msgid ""
"**目标：** 每帧替换 3~8% 的 Si 为 Ge，每帧生成 20 个版本，覆盖不同掺杂落点"
msgstr ""
"**Objective:** Replace 3-8% of Si with Ge and generate 20 site arrangements "
"per input."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:49
#: 999dcc66d4fd4e648d27d97dd1c7c2bf
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:50
#: 10105340b7e84cadbfe6d8eb74c31cb6
msgid ""
"`规则`（`rules`）：target=`Si`, dopants=`Ge`, use=`atomic_percent`, "
"percent=`[3, 8]`"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:51
#: acdf7b1371ee4bcb8d99ad718c06aabd
msgid "`掺杂方式`（`doping_type`）：`Exact` （对比实验需要稳定的掺杂数量）"
msgstr "See the parameter description for details."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:52
#: 70b294504e9f48fe891062f895ac5c7f
msgid "`Structures`：`[20]`"
msgstr "`Structures`: `[20]`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:54
#: ab21f5b771e64039a53035d6d6e585d0
msgid ""
"**输出：** 20 个掺杂结构，每帧中 3~8% 的 Si 变成 Ge，带 `Dop(n=...)` 标签"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Twenty doped structures with 3-8% of Si sites changed to Ge and "
"label `Dop(n=...)`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:56
#: 70b74b198db7443586de6a708b9cb4a9
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:57
#: 826afbde46a1485fb59821818d079f67
msgid "重训后跑 Si:Ge 测试集，力的 MAE 应该回到和纯 Si 训练集接近的水平"
msgstr ""
"After DFT labeling and retraining, force MAE on a Si:Ge test set should "
"approach the in-domain Si error."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:58
#: e9d9a3584d1f4bdfab14fe6b454a048a
msgid ""
"抽查几个掺杂输出，Ge 原子的最近邻距离是否合理（Si-Ge 键长应略大于 Si-Si）"
msgstr ""
"Inspect dopant-centered nearest-neighbor distances and confirm they are "
"chemically plausible."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:59
#: 0b96b2df533c4af3a3a6b663181cd37a
msgid "如果模型对高浓度掺杂仍然不准，扩大 `percent` 上限到 15~20%"
msgstr ""
"If high-concentration tests remain out of domain, extend the training range "
"deliberately, for example toward 15-20%."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:60
#: badaa6b6062f4a088eb682a9f8a8b56b
msgid "如果只掺一种元素，dopants 可以直接写 `Ge`，等价于 `Ge:1.0`"
msgstr "For one dopant, `Ge` is equivalent to `Ge:1.0`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:61
#: 12b398defe9d466d8b888f9f29439606
msgid "如果需要多元素掺杂（如同时掺 Ge 和 C），在 dopants 里写 `Ge:0.7,C:0.3`"
msgstr "For mixed dopants, use weights such as `Ge:0.7,C:0.3`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:63
#: d90c8e825b304178a0ed8d8213f59216
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:65
#: 937bc9a622fd4a2c9001aa644ea3f88a
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:66
#: 7ce3a81be1ea40b694a46aa24dd26b6c
msgid "模型在掺杂/合金体系上预测质量明显差于纯元素体系"
msgstr ""
"Predictions on doped or alloy structures are much worse than on the pure "
"system"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:67
#: 925a7ad896704b749b20af3e92131d0b
msgid "需要覆盖特定掺杂元素周围的局域化学环境"
msgstr "Local chemistry around a specific dopant is missing"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:68
#: 69a6d07e44bf48409ce67e8a1471280f
msgid "有明确的掺杂规则（target + dopants + 比例），但不需系统扫描完整配比空间"
msgstr ""
"An explicit target, dopant, and amount rule is known without a full "
"composition scan"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:70
#: 2f07e0b4caa04e12a63a7526cdddf456
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:71
#: 51326ba3a95b46b7831618ca7ba76ac4
msgid ""
"需要系统扫配比空间 → 先用 `Composition Space Sampling`，再接 `Random "
"Occupancy`"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:72
#: 87f49853cec3487db7e8f96f43e3b841
msgid "只需要全局随机占位 → 用 `Random Occupancy`"
msgstr "Only global occupation diversity is needed; use `Random Occupancy`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:74
#: 0d8e39d347f1483f97756d473fbf6687
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:76
#: b831537e897840a98f82d138e80d2dff
msgid "规则（rules）"
msgstr "rules"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:78
#: d8126b6363e046369fa920f053e044d9
msgid ""
"`list[dict[str, Any]]`，默认空列表。每条 rule 定义目标元素、替换元素、比例/计"
"数和可选 group。复杂掺杂优先拆成多条明确 rule，不要把不同物理缺陷混成一个概率"
"池。"
msgstr ""
"`list[dict[str, Any]]`, empty by default. Each rule defines a target "
"element, dopants, an amount, and an optional group. Keep distinct physical "
"defects in separate explicit rules rather than one ambiguous probability "
"pool."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:80
#: 57f7eee98d4743308da80848d23f05b7
msgid ""
"rule 内的典型字段：`target`（被替换元素）、`dopants`（替换元素及权重 dict）、"
"`ratio_type`（dopants 权重采用 `atom` 原子比或 `mass` 质量比）、`use`"
"（`atomic_percent` / `mass_percent` / `count`）、`percent`（百分比范围 "
"`[min, max]` 或 `[fixed]`）、`count`（固定替换个数或随机范围）、`count_mode`"
"（`fixed` / `random`）、`group`（可选，限制只在此 group 内操作）。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:82
#: 1c3779d329fe4aa5ac5b9392effef689
msgid ""
"`percent` 必须落在 0~100；百分比换算成离散原子数时向下取整，因此小超胞的低百"
"分比可能得到 0 个替换。明确设置 0% 会保留原结构，不会被强制改成 1 个掺杂原"
"子。固定数量、随机数量或质量百分比范围会先按上界计算最大请求数；只要上界可能"
"超过当前候选位点数，整条规则就会确定性报错，不会因 seed 不同而时而成功、时而"
"失败，也不会静默截断。多种 dopant 的质量百分比换算会按 `ratio_type` 对应的原"
"子分数计算平均质量；切换规则里的“原子比/质量比”会改变换算和元素分配。填写 "
"group 后，如果输入没有 `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]`、标签未命中或目标元素未命"
"中，也会明确报错。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:84
#: c804bcaf8b474f08afc99d70a58db8c5
msgid "掺杂方式（doping_type）"
msgstr "doping_type"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:86
#: ed932bc03e7c43cab936d9de455c1721
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Random`。这个选项控制多个 dopant 如何分配到已经选定的替换位点，"
"不改变 `percent` 或 `count` 推导出的替换总数。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:0
#: 5707087fedd549c59eded78875705ab8
msgid "选项"
msgstr "Options"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:0
#: 66de2ef38a914dc5a738b527f2a3ca99
msgid "含义"
msgstr "Meaning"

