#: 3a7f348c8d6c4ff6b8d37b5f2914a88a
msgid "什么时候选"
msgstr "When to choose it"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:0
#: 99aee9569a0b49029ac7e7df888e1ec0
msgid "`Random`"
msgstr "`Random`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:0
#: 85b895b9c3ee4e049e5fec91302e25f2
msgid "每个替换位点按 dopant 权重独立抽样"
msgstr "Sample each replacement site independently from dopant weights"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:0
#: da8acdb9481143c49c078631cc3f1900
msgid "需要统计涨落和更多随机组成时"
msgstr "When statistical fluctuations and more random compositions are needed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:0
#: cb77bc18356a4e2dbf3ee058382c75e2
msgid "`Exact`"
msgstr "`Exact`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:0
#: 302eb3b4546243249571ae468e0b27ed
msgid "用最大余数法把权重换成整数计数，再随机打乱落点"
msgstr "Convert weights to integer counts with the largest-remainder method, then randomize their sites"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:0
#: 53c12dbb08b3424e8e0d1e85cd11978d
msgid "对比实验需要每帧 dopant 计数尽量贴近目标比例时"
msgstr "When comparative experiments require dopant counts in each frame to stay close to the target ratio"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:93
#: e1c6e83e206b4b75a04d08f996f329fd
msgid "最大结构数（max_structures）"
msgstr "max_structures"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:95
#: 611487f2b48f4ee0ae920f5d432d98c5
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 1。每个输入结构最多输出的掺杂构型数。低浓度精确掺杂可用 10-50，高"
