msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:177
#: 6d20a933a79a4be2b1181155bab8ae64
msgid "`Group Label` → `Random Doping`：只掺杂特定子晶格/层，不污染其他区域"
msgstr ""
"`Group Label` -> `Random Doping`: restrict doping to a sublattice or layer"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:178
#: bb38311e45e2456fba6780c067a6b92b
msgid ""
"`Composition Space Sampling` → `Random Occupancy` → `Random Doping`：先扫配"
"比 → 落位 → 再补局部随机替换"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:179
#: bd65f638d0624616aabae0c0f06c09f4
msgid "`Random Doping` → `Atomic Perturb`：掺杂后加坐标噪声，松驰局部应力"
msgstr ""
"`Random Doping` -> `Atomic Perturb`: add local coordinate diversity after "
"substitution; physical labels still require relaxation"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:181
#: fd20cf4076df4be0b5c1045de6c22a32
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:183
#: b00412ca913741fbaed9bf3fefedd887
msgid ""
"**输出和输入一样，没有替换。** 空 rules 会保留输入；显式 0% 或小超胞中百分比"
"向下取整为 0 时，也会得到未替换端点。target 不存在、group 缺失或标签未命中则"
"会直接报错，不再生成假成功输出。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:185
#: aa2668912f4842639f60e75595df3795
msgid ""
"**掺杂比例偏离预期。** 如果用 `Random` 模式，小样本下统计浮动大。换成 "
"`Exact` 可以减少波动。如果用的是 `mass_percent`，确认目标元素和掺杂元素的质量"
"差异是否导致了原子比例偏移。"
msgstr ""
"**Dopant fraction differs from expectation.** Small Random samples "
"fluctuate; use Exact for stable counts. With `mass_percent`, atomic "
"fractions also reflect target-dopant mass differences."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:187
#: 235aaa33a6634171912224c0332da7c6
msgid ""
"**掺杂后键长异常。** 这是纯化学替换，不做结构弛豫。替换后键长取决于新元素的原"
"子半径和原晶格参数的匹配度。如果键长明显不合理，建议后接弛豫计算。"
msgstr ""
"**Bond lengths are abnormal.** Substitution does not relax geometry. Relax "
"before using such structures as physical training labels."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:189
#: 43016df2aaa644cc8f829bfa04d783e6
msgid ""
"**提示请求数量超过候选位点。** 卡片不会替你把 10 个改成“最多能换的 4 个”。范"
"围参数按上界校验；请降低 `count` 或 `percent` 上限、扩大超胞，或检查前一条规"
"则是否已经消耗了相同 target/group 的候选位点。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:191
#: f587db574acf4f3da4b8e7a0bd346eae
msgid ""
"**多条规则之间的交互。** 规则按顺序执行。如果多条规则操作重叠的 target/group "
"候选池，卡片会按各范围上界联合预检；只要前面的规则存在耗尽后续容量的可能，就"
"会在随机采样前统一报错，而不是让同一工作流随 seed 时成时败。需要保留多条规则"
"时，应改用互不重叠的 group；同一候选池上的多种 dopant 通常应合并到一条规则的 "
"`dopants` 中。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:193
#: 53b4edc90c78426f896be40247ee372f
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:195
#: 65455b021bbc41c58e30fc66e13091d6
msgid "`Dop(n={替换原子数})`"
msgstr "`Dop(n={number of substituted atoms})`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:197
#: f1a6fbd0aa4c4892b3af3065a38e5567
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:199
#: a02faaf627ea4496884aabf47249ba20
msgid ""
"勾选 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`） + 固定 `随机种子`（`seed`）可复现。同一候选"
"位点顺序会复用同一随机路径，因此批量结构若原子排序完全一致，掺杂落点编号也可"
"能一致；需要结构间更丰富的落点时，应使用不同 seed 或在上游生成不同占位顺序。"
"建议把 seed 与 pipeline 配置一起版本化。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "按规则表对指定元素位点做替位掺杂。可以精确控制\"替换谁、换成什么、换多少"
#~ "\"，支持按原子百分比、质量百分比或固定数量采样。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Apply substitutional doping to specified element sites using an explicit "
#~ "rule table. Each rule controls which species is replaced, the dopant "
#~ "distribution, and the amount by atomic percentage, mass percentage, or "
#~ "fixed count."

#~ msgid "**和 `Random Occupancy` / `Composition Sweep` 的区别：**"
#~ msgstr "**How it differs from `Random Occupancy` and `Composition Sweep`:**"

#~ msgid "`Composition Sweep`：定义\"目标配比空间\"，不改原子占位"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Composition Sweep` defines a target-composition space without changing "
#~ "occupations."

#~ msgid "`Doping Type`：`Exact` （对比实验需要稳定的掺杂数量）"
#~ msgstr "`Doping Type`: `Exact` for a stable dopant count in comparisons."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "需要系统扫配比空间 → 先用 `Composition Sweep`，再接 `Random Occupancy`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A composition domain must be scanned; use `Composition Sweep` followed by "
#~ "`Random Occupancy`"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "rule 内的典型字段：`target`（被替换元素）、`dopants`（替换元素及权重 "
#~ "dict）、`use`（`atomic_percent` / `mass_percent` / `count`）、`percent`"
#~ "（百分比范围 `[min, max]` 或 `[fixed]`）、`count`（固定替换个数）、`group`"
#~ "（可选，限制只在此 group 内操作）。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Typical rule fields are `target`, weighted `dopants`, `use` "
#~ "(`atomic_percent`, `mass_percent`, or `count`), `percent` (`[min,max]` or "
#~ "`[fixed]`), fixed `count`, and optional `group` restriction."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `Random`。`Random` 按权重概率随机采样，每帧替换数量有浮动。"
#~ "`Exact` 尽量匹配精确计数，替换数量更稳定，适合对比实验。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `Random`. `Random` samples weighted probabilities and "
#~ "permits count fluctuations. `Exact` matches integer counts as closely as "
#~ "possible and is better for controlled comparisons."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Composition Sweep` → `Random Occupancy` → `Random Doping`：先扫配比 → 落"
#~ "位 → 再补局部随机替换"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Composition Sweep` -> `Random Occupancy` -> `Random Doping`: scan "
#~ "composition, realize occupations, then add targeted substitutions"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出和输入一样，没有替换。** 检查 rules 是否为空、target 元素是否真的存"
#~ "在于输入结构中、group 过滤是否把候选位点全滤掉了。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output is unchanged.** Check for nonempty rules, a target present in "
#~ "the input, and a group filter that leaves eligible sites."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**多条规则之间的交互。** 规则按顺序执行。如果两条规则操作同一个 target 元"
#~ "素，第二条会在第一条的结果上继续替换。注意不要设计互相冲突的规则。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Rule interactions.** Rules execute in order. A later rule targeting the "
#~ "same species operates on the result of earlier rules, so avoid conflicts."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` 可复现。注意输入结构顺序变化也会影响结果——建"
#~ "议把 seed 与 pipeline 配置一起版本化。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` for reproducibility. Input order also "
#~ "affects derived samples, so version the seed with the pipeline "
#~ "configuration."
